        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandi kagan hei luai guang the,",
            "Karam gaini kim the;",
            "Akhang gai mbumei makge,",
            "Apoubaomei Jisu hamhma",
            "Kandi ramgai ai kahau dat lak khe,",
            "Akhang rui kacha dat lakmei",
            "Zion ram khou tei.",
            "",
            "Akhang Zion ram,",
            "Akhang mi Zion ram,",
            "Akhang rui Poubaomei, rui",
            "Chamdaan loumei Zion ram.",
            "",
            "2. Apoubaomei keidat puni,",
            "Katik kagun daina;",
            "Tingpuk kandi luai guangpui nung,",
            "Kacha lak khe Zion ram tei,",
            "Tingkao nthanmei nun le bam chamhni,",
            "Rianramei muang rui zing,",
            "Ata sumlou o Poubaomei!",
            "",
            "3. Himdaihmei Guang ram tingkao tei,",
            "Ai ningtou machun e;",
            "Guang ramgai tei ai houni e,",
            "He! Namthanh ringhmei gaanghmei ram,",
            "Kandi rianramei ninga ai kap e,",
            "Ringsuangmei tingkao kaidai khou tei,",
            "Aniu tat puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
